	(text "Expansion header J8 (fit on demand). Every signal: 330R series (MCU side) + TPD4E05U06 ESD clamp at the pin.\n330R limits a short to GND/3V3 or a 5V mis-wire to a few mA. Power pins: PTC fuse + TVS.\nSPI3: PC10 SCK, PC11 MISO, PC12 MOSI, PA15 CS. USART6: PC6 TX, PC7 RX. FDCAN1: PB8 RX, PB9 TX.\nADC: PA0 PA3 PA4 PA6 PB1 PC0 PC2 PC3. I2C1 (shared with U5 TMP1075). Verify AFs in CubeMX."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
